WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.360
Suruga-sama is still Suruga-sama.

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.620
That will never change, no matter what.

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.280
I see.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.620
The perfect puppet.

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:30.130
And your job is to save him before 
that happens, Hadaebou.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:34.510
If he cannot be saved, 
his life is to be taken.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:39.610
That is what Tenkai told you to do, yes?

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:15.940
<b><i>Murakumo Must Be Destroyed</i></b>

00:02:19.190 --> 00:02:20.820
You bastard...

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:51.480
I already told you that your eye 
magic will not work on me.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.310
Your plan was to attack me, suddenly,

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:01.310
provoking an instant desire to harm you.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.670
Something a child would dream up.

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:10.030
Feel free to try it again.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:14.300
See whether your eye magic works

00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.300
as I push this blade through your chest.

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:29.210
Then, I don't need my eye magic!

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:31.390
I'll kill you with my sword!

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:36.900
You think you can kill me?

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.750
What's wrong?

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:45.840
Out of breath already?

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.780
Are you hurt?

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.210
Worry about Hachirou, not me.

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:51.780
Hachirou is here.

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:56.550
We thought he might be here...

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.860
Did he go to Murakumo on his own?

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.420
Where did you see him?

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.540
Near the eastern forest.

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:07.050
We were being chased by Rain riflemen.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.280
Hachisu...

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:10.010
Yes, leave it to me.

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.540
Shikibu, you take care of this.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:13.430
Right. Let's go, Hibiki.

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:43.670
I hope your plan is working...

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:46.060
I don't know.

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:51.010
The enemy probably knew that 
we'd attempt a diversion.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.970
Then, why?

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.970
Sometimes, even in a damezumari, 
a new move will reveal itself.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.730
A damezumari?

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:00.830
A term from Go.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:05.020
When you and the enemy are in 
the midst of a chaotic battle,

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.230
unexpected moves can appear.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.810
While the enemy focuses on the 
battle right in front of them...

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:13.510
Namenba, that's your cue.

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:16.870
But everyone won't...

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:20.770
They should send the signal soon.

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:27.030
Saizou, isn't there anything we can do?

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:29.880
Shut up. I'm thinking.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.640
I guess we'll try it.

00:07:58.130 --> 00:07:59.270
Suruga-sama...

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:05.510
Rui, take Shichigen and ready the boat.

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:07.020
We're retreating?

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.730
It's an important job. Do it, please.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:10.620
Shichigen...

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:12.560
Okay.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:18.090
There's something I want to see.

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:21.140
Utsutsu, fire the cannon for me.

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:24.830
What's the point of doing the 
same thing over again?

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:43.270
Now, hurry... Please get out of here.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:44.790
I'm not going back.

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:46.700
Why?

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:49.710
Joujin is only using you.

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.290
Once he's done with you,

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.820
you'll just be killed!

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:55.430
I'm not going back.

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:59.890
If you insist on not returning,

00:08:59.890 --> 00:09:03.800
His Excellency Tenkai has told me 
to take your life on the spot.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.810
Are you certain?

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:08.880
I'm not going back.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:10.940
I'm not going back.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.110
I'm not going back.

00:09:15.100 --> 00:09:16.530
This is another fake...

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:17.900
Again?

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.280
Did you hear that?

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:10.680
As suspected, the inhabitants of 
Chiyoda Castle intend to slay you.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:17.050
I have seen your true intentions!

00:10:17.270 --> 00:10:23.260
Return and tell Tenkai that I 
will rule Japan with Joujin!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:24.870
Suruga-sama...

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:37.910
Even if it was an illusion, he still 
slew it without hesitation.

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:44.030
Suruga-sama, ruling is a 
cruel thing, is it not?

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:22.230
Return and tell them about how 
terrifying we Joujinshuu are.

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:32.000
Join me.

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.290
What?

00:11:35.070 --> 00:11:36.960
What are you planning?

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:42.740
We no longer have cause to defeat 
the leader of the Five Treasures.

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:45.680
Our goal has been achieved.

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:48.180
Then why try to convince me to join?

00:11:48.380 --> 00:11:50.390
Betrayal is the way of the world.

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:54.650
Normally, ninjas act for their own benefit.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:58.440
Stop letting hatred and the desire 
for vengeance blind you.

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:00.820
Tell me what you want.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.570
I do not act for myself.

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:06.990
You— no, the two of you, your bloodline.

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:12.710
We want the blood flowing through the 
veins of Kouga Hachirou and Iga Hibiki.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:18.610
Even you would use me... use us?!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:24.250
Your other choice is to die by my blade.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:25.930
Don't underestimate me, monster!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.150
Monster, am I?

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:30.840
Doesn't the same word apply to you two?

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:34.150
You have the power of monsters and demons,

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:36.230
the power to set the world alight!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.730
Enough talk.

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.730
I will give you another chance.

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:43.490
Join me.

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:44.680
Enough!

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.980
Fool!

00:12:49.020 --> 00:12:50.490
Hachirou!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.520
Hibiki!

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:21.620
Kujaku. Can you hear me, Kujaku?

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:24.530
Joujin-sama?

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:27.650
Fire the Shiroku cannon in the 
direction of the eastern hill,

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:29.880
where Hachirou and his ninjas are.

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:31.450
The Shiroku cannon?

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:34.540
Won't that kill them?

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.790
If it does, they were of 
no value to us, anyway.

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:40.050
As you wish.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:54.250
The cannon's changing direction!

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:55.850
It's moving toward...

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:59.060
Toward us!

00:13:59.350 --> 00:14:01.080
Run along the river!

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.820
Or else you'll be caught in landslides!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.550
Shikibu!

00:14:56.650 --> 00:14:58.970
That light... It can't be...

00:14:58.970 --> 00:14:59.900
Ouka?

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:18.460
So they used it?

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:20.270
Gorone?

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:23.590
Is that it?

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:27.150
Shichigen, is that...

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:28.660
Ouka...

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:00.430
Splendid!

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:03.130
I will say it, once more.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:06.690
Entrust me with your power.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.940
Come and join me.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.700
Stop it.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:24.410
In your condition, if you use it again,

00:16:24.410 --> 00:16:26.210
you could die.

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:42.600
You would sacrifice your own lives, then?

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:48.530
Magoroku!

00:16:57.310 --> 00:16:58.740
Joujin-sama!

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:16.180
Splendid!

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:20.010
I can understand Joujin-sama's obsession!

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:47.640
Hachirou! Hibiki!

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:53.600
I'm counting on you, Utsutsu!

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:54.390
Right!

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:03.950
Sheesh. They finally gave up, huh?

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.840
Joujin-sama!

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:34.860
I'm fine.

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:36.480
No need to worry.

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:40.090
Joujin-sama, this is the second 
time they've used Ouka.

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:43.350
But they appear not to have mastered it yet.

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:46.290
They will need time.

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:49.350
When the time is right, 
we can simply acquire them.

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.320
As you ordered,

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:56.360
we sent Tenkai's servant, 
Hadaebou, home alive.

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.050
Very well.

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:02.180
Tenkai will be quite flustered.

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:03.840
Joujin!

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:09.640
If you left Hadaebou alive, that may 
as well be a declaration of war!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:13.360
I say we cross the river now 
and begin our assault.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:17.230
There's no need for such a hurry.

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:19.870
Strategy is an important part of war.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:24.390
First, we need to cause them to panic.

00:19:25.340 --> 00:19:28.390
Th-That's true, but...

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:31.150
Where is Kujaku?

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:34.900
He's playing on top of the cannon.

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:40.150
All these years, and he still 
has the heart of a child.

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:49.840
If this fails, it's over.

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:51.420
We only have one cannonball.

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:52.880
Right.

00:19:58.410 --> 00:19:59.010
Let's go!

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:11.000
They keep doing the same thing!

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:29.950
Gorone!

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:31.830
Go, Namenba!

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:39.960
Stupid!

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:41.690
I knew it!

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:45.880
There's a gap when he can't 
use his time reversal!

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:46.770
Namenba!

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:48.350
4-12! Black Kite!

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:54.720
The stars have disappeared!

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:55.480
This is...

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:26.970
Let's get out of here!

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:27.010
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:29.260
Once more, the demon begins to grow.

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:34.140
Higurashi Shichigen sees a memory of 
his mother, deep within the tunnel.

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:36.220
He sees the truth.

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:38.640
<b><i>The Shielding Eye is Deceived</i></b>

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:37.930
And Hibiki...

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:38.940
You...
